{"kind":"table","sheet":"README","address":"A1:E36","rows":36,"cols":5,"values":[["《一笔镇妖》游戏配置工作簿",null,null,null,null],["正式内容唯一源为 Design/Config/GameConfig.xlsx；config/ 下同名模板仅作同步镜像。运行时只读导出的JSON，不解析xlsx。",null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null],["项目","规则",null,"配置对象","示例条目数"],["Schema版本",4,null,"Players",1],["内容版本","0.5.2-sample",null,"Stances",2],["配置源","Design/Config/GameConfig.xlsx",null,"Enemies",7],["运行时快照","Assets/_Game/Config/Generated/gameplay_config.json",null,"EnemyAttacks",10],[null,null,null,"Projectiles",5],[null,null,null,"Buffs",6],[null,null,null,"Skills",3],[null,null,null,"Levels",3],[null,null,null,"Waves",12],[null,null,null,"Spawns",15],[null,null,null,"BossPhases",3],[null,null,null,"Tutorials",8],[null,null,null,"Texts",37],[null,null,null,"AssetManifest",76],[null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null],["使用步骤",null,null,null,null],["1","只修改正式源；字段名是API；稳定ID使用小写英文/数字/下划线且发布后不复用。",null,null,null],["2","导出器执行结构、类型、唯一性、范围、枚举、外键和跨表语义校验。",null,null,null],["3","JSON固定表序/行序；contentHash对排除自身后的规范化内容计算SHA-256。",null,null,null],["4","Unity只读JSON；AssetRegistrySO只维护assetKey到Unity对象引用。",null,null,null],["5","坏配置整包拒绝，不允许半应用，也不在Inspector复制同一数值。",null,null,null],["6","字段变更同步FieldDictionary、Schema、导出器、DTO、校验、文档和测试。FieldDictionary不递归描述自身。",null,null,null],["7","发布前校验Web、微信转换、开发者工具和真机，四层证据互不替代。",null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null],["配置所有权",null,null,null,null],["Excel","表头/ID/枚举契约由程序与策划共同审批；内容与平衡值由策划维护",null,null,null],["JSON","导出器唯一生成的只读构建快照；禁止人工维护",null,null,null],["C#","规则算法、DTO和注册表；不保存关卡、敌人或技能数值",null,null,null],["Inspector/SO","只保存Unity资源/场景引用和明确调试兜底；不做第二数值库",null,null,null]]}
